## Free License

### Who is eligible

You may use the Software for free if you are:

- an individual;
- a for-profit organization with **up to 3 employees**, counting all its affiliates together;
- a non-profit or not-for-profit organization; or
- evaluating whether the Software fits your needs, and not yet using it commercially.

### What you may do

If you are eligible, you are granted a free, worldwide, non-exclusive license to:

- use the Software, commercially or not, to create videos, images and audio;
- copy and modify the Software for your own use;
- share your modifications publicly as contributions back to this project.

### What you may not do

You may not:

- sell, rent, lease, license, sublicense or otherwise commercially distribute the Software, or any modified or derived version of it;
- offer the Software, or a derived version, to third parties as a hosted or managed service;
- remove or change this license or the copyright notice.

